+
+### F-1 — Critical — `deposit()` always reverts against the real USDT
+
+`src/UsdtYieldVault.sol:94`
+
+```solidity
+usdt.approve(address(aavePool), amount);
+```
+
+`usdt` is typed `IERC20`, whose `approve` is declared `returns (bool)`. Solidity
+therefore requires at least 32 bytes of return data and reverts if it does not get
+them. The deployed TetherToken declares `approve` with **no return value**. The
+call succeeds, returns zero bytes, and the vault's own frame reverts while decoding.
+
+`safeTransferFrom` on line 93 is fine — `SafeERC20` tolerates the missing return.
+Line 94 is the only raw `IERC20` call in the contract, and it is the fatal one.
+
+**Evidence — the live chain:**
+
+```
+$ cast call 0xdAC17F958D2ee523a2206206994597C13D831ec7 "approve(address,uint256)" 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 0 --rpc-url https://eth.drpc.org
+0x
+```
+
+Zero bytes of return data.
+
+**Evidence — the vault, on a mainnet fork, against the real USDT, the real Aave
+V3 pool at `0x87870Bca...` and the real aUSDT:**
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-path 'test/review/ForkMainnet.t.sol' --fork-url https://eth.drpc.org --fork-block-number 25845000 -vv
+
+Ran 5 tests for test/review/ForkMainnet.t.sol:ForkMainnetTest
+[PASS] test_Fork_Control_RealAaveAcceptsRealUsdt() (gas: 404192)
+Logs:
+  aUSDT minted to control rig: 999999999
+
+[PASS] test_Fork_Evidence_AaveCreditsLessThanSupplied() (gas: 403793)
+Logs:
+  USDT supplied to Aave      : 1000000000
+  aUSDT credited by Aave     : 999999999
+  shortfall the vault records: 1
+
+[PASS] test_Fork_Evidence_DepositRevertsOnMainnet() (gas: 122426)
+[PASS] test_Fork_Evidence_UsdtApproveReturnsNoData() (gas: 39719)
+[FAIL: EvmError: Revert] test_Fork_Spec_DepositWorksOnMainnet() (gas: 117906)
+Suite result: FAILED. 4 passed; 1 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 8.93ms (12.59ms CPU time)
+
+Ran 1 test suite in 1.63s (8.93ms CPU time): 4 tests passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped (5 total tests)
+
+Failing tests:
+Encountered 1 failing test in test/review/ForkMainnet.t.sol:ForkMainnetTest
+[FAIL: EvmError: Revert] test_Fork_Spec_DepositWorksOnMainnet() (gas: 117906)
+```
+
+Note `test_Fork_Control_RealAaveAcceptsRealUsdt`, which **passes**: the same fork,
+the same USDT, the same Aave pool, the same 1,000 USDT — supplied through a rig
+that uses `SafeERC20.forceApprove`. Aave, USDT and the fork are all fine. The
+vault is not.
+
+The trace pins the exact instruction:
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-test test_Fork_Spec_DepositWorksOnMainnet --fork-url https://eth.drpc.org --fork-block-number 25845000 -vvvv
