+
+### F-4 — High — the withdrawal fee is destroyed, not redistributed
+
+README.md and the contract's own NatSpec (`src/UsdtYieldVault.sol:17-18`) both say:
+
+> Both fees stay supplied in Aave and accrue to the remaining shareholders — they
+> are not swept to the owner.
+
+That is true of the deposit fee. It is false of the withdrawal fee.
+
+`src/UsdtYieldVault.sol:111-119`
+
+```solidity
+uint256 grossAssets = convertToAssets(shares);
+uint256 fee = (grossAssets * WITHDRAW_FEE_BPS) / BPS_DENOMINATOR;
+netAssets = grossAssets - fee;
+...
+totalAssetsStored -= grossAssets;          // the full gross leaves the books
+aavePool.withdraw(address(usdt), netAssets, msg.sender);   // only the net leaves Aave
+```
+
+The fee is subtracted from `totalAssetsStored` but never withdrawn from Aave. Both
+the numerator and the denominator of the share price shrink in exact proportion, so
+the remaining holders' price is unchanged and the fee simply falls out of the
+accounting into the same unreachable pile as F-3.
+
+**Evidence:**
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-test test_Spec_WithdrawFeeAccruesToRemainingShareholders -vv
+
+Ran 1 test for test/review/UsdtYieldVaultSpec.t.sol:UsdtYieldVaultSpecTest
+[FAIL: alice's exit fee must accrue to bob: 1 !~= 3001500 (max delta: 1, real delta: 3001499)] test_Spec_WithdrawFeeAccruesToRemainingShareholders() (gas: 2545582)
+Logs:
+  alice's 0.3% exit fee   : 3001500
+  bob claim before her exit: 999499749
+  bob claim after  her exit: 999499750
+  bob actually gained      : 1
+```
+
+Alice pays a 3.0015 USDT exit fee. Bob, the only remaining shareholder, gains
+**1 base unit** — and that 1 unit is floor-division noise, not the fee.
+
+Combined with F-3, over a full lifecycle:
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-test test_Spec_NothingIsStrandedAfterFullExit -vv
+
+Ran 1 test for test/review/UsdtYieldVaultSpec.t.sol:UsdtYieldVaultSpecTest
+[FAIL: no USDT may be left unclaimable: 1060000000 > 1] test_Spec_NothingIsStrandedAfterFullExit() (gas: 2557702)
+Logs:
+  totalShares after full exit: 0
+  USDT stranded in the vault : 1060000000
+```
+
+Two depositors, 20,000 USDT, 5% interest. Everyone exits. **1,060 USDT — 5.3% of
+principal — is left in Aave with zero shares outstanding.** Unreachable, forever.
+
+The stateful invariant finds the same thing from random call sequences:
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-path 'test/review/VaultInvariants.t.sol'
+
+[FAIL: more than 1 USDT in Aave that no share can redeem: 184761981 > 1000000]
+	[Sequence] (original: 7, shrunk: 2)
+		sender=0x000000000000000000000000000000003F7286F4 addr=[test/review/VaultInvariants.t.sol:VaultHandler]0x5991A2dF15A8F6A256D3Ec51E99254Cd3fb576A9 calldata=deposit(uint256,uint256) args=[637, 417968 [4.179e5]]
+		sender=0xF0c65e7fb76cD707De8Bd6Cc3149Dd987dF2000E addr=[test/review/VaultInvariants.t.sol:VaultHandler]0x5991A2dF15A8F6A256D3Ec51E99254Cd3fb576A9 calldata=withdraw(uint256,uint256) args=[35235558809276021365745685717582097385918842071918822658 [3.523e55], 9414754141044169804717746833468584579210582805224826812281658268672648681 [9.414e72]]
+ invariant_C_NoUnredeemableAssets() (runs: 0, calls: 0, reverts: 0)
+[PASS] invariant_B_SharesSumToTotalShares() (runs: 256, calls: 128000, reverts: 0)
+Suite result: FAILED. 2 passed; 2 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 10.60s (19.54s CPU time)
+```
+
+The invariant runner picks its own seeds, so the shrunk sequence and the exact
+number will differ between runs, and `invariant_D` will pass on some seeds and fail
+on others. The two deterministic tests above (`test_Spec_NothingIsStrandedAfterFullExit`,
+`test_Spec_WithdrawFeeAccruesToRemainingShareholders`) fail every time; treat those
+as the reproducible evidence and the invariants as corroboration.
+
+**Fix.** Decide what the fee is for and implement that:
+- To make the documentation true — the fee accrues to remaining holders — withdraw
+  the **gross** from Aave and send the net to the user, keeping the fee's aUSDT in
+  the vault where balance-based `totalAssets()` (F-3) prices it into everyone
+  else's shares. With storage-based accounting the equivalent is
+  `totalAssetsStored -= netAssets`.
+- To pay the fee to the protocol, add a `feeRecipient` and transfer it there
+  explicitly.
+
+Either way, add an invariant test that the sum of all claims equals
+`aUsdt.balanceOf(address(this))` and update the README to match whichever you pick.
+
